       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-HAPTIC-VISC.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-VISC-PROOFS.
           05  WS-VISCOSITY-DAMPING-OK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-KINETIC-DISSIPATION-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-HAPTIC-VISC-SEAL-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-HAPTIC-VISC-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-HAPTIC-PROVEN        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-HAPTIC-CODE        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-VISCOSITY-AND-YIELD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-LATENCY-AND-DISSIPATION.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAPTIC-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-VISCOSITY-AND-YIELD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-VISCOSITY-DAMPING-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-LATENCY-AND-DISSIPATION.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-KINETIC-DISSIPATION-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-HAPTIC-PROOFS.
           IF WS-VISCOSITY-DAMPING-OK = 1 AND
              WS-PLASTIC-YIELD-OK = 1 AND
              WS-HAPTIC-LATENCY-OK = 1 AND
              WS-KINETIC-DISSIPATION-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-HAPTIC-VISC-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-HAPTIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-HAPTIC-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-HAPTIC-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-HAPTIC-CODE.
